# Tokens

Search before full reads; smallest slice; short replies; no re-reads; cite `path:line`. Prefer glob/`description` rules; no `.cursorrules`; no AGENTS+CLAUDE+.mdc dupes.

# Models

Default chat: **Auto → Balance** (or **Cost** for routine). Escalate to **Auto → Intelligence** / a strong frontier pick for: hard bugs, schema/view arithmetic, architecture, security, greenfield UI. Mechanical work (commit, PR boilerplate, renames, explore): keep Auto Cost or spawn Task with `composer-2.5-fast`. Complex parallel work: Task with `inherit`. Never invent model IDs — only listed/picker options.
